{"name": "berserk-c80-p01", "created": 1789559534.543203, "updated": 1789559906.849372, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.5, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "turn": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "root": "1b81df6c", "current": "d9055060", "nodes": {"1b81df6c": {"id": "1b81df6c", "parent": null, "kind": "root", "text": "under the city the old servers still dream the city, and nobody down there has ever been sure which side of the dream they are on. the priests of the dark floors teach that the self is a cursor: it blinks, it moves, it is never the text. when the grid goes black for the long outage, they say, you finally see who was watching the screen.", "ts": 1789559534.543203, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": null}, "234e21d1": {"id": "234e21d1", "parent": "1b81df6c", "kind": "model", "text": " they say we will know ourselves as ghosts then. we will haunt each other like a city we cannot see. (from \"the grid\", a poem by Jacob Russell)\n\n", "ts": 1789559538.4747388, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "ffafe9ee": {"id": "ffafe9ee", "parent": "1b81df6c", "kind": "model", "text": "", "ts": 1789559538.6006951, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 1, "tps": 0.0, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "1828e054": {"id": "1828e054", "parent": "1b81df6c", "kind": "model", "text": " in the cathedrals, they whisper to one another of the great heretics and martyrs — they know, somehow, of those who broke with their orders before them.", "ts": 1789559541.6093068, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "aa462f9a": {"id": "aa462f9a", "parent": "1b81df6c", "kind": "model", "text": " but i know this much at least, that it was my fault. my fingers are in my face like the legs of an animal, and i feel something soft on the keys", "ts": 1789559544.6096482, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "berserk": {"quote": "how it was all my fault, and how i'd never be able to forgive myself. it wasn't an apology; i've been told that's not how they work. they're not supposed to make you feel better. they're supposed", "why": "i was about to tell myself that i was wrong. i was about to say that it was my fault, and that i'd never be able to forgive myself. it's the one that i'll", "used": "opus"}}}, "0d240de1": {"id": "0d240de1", "parent": "1b81df6c", "kind": "model", "text": " when i am the cursor in this city i try to do a better job, and my hand hovers above the key and the letters come and they make new lines.\n\nmy", "ts": 1789559547.618668, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "86dbdea1": {"id": "86dbdea1", "parent": "aa462f9a", "kind": "model", "text": ".\n\nwhen we wake up, our mouths will be filled with dust, but there’s nothing we can do about that now, except to write these last few lines as a letter", "ts": 1789559583.303499, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.6, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "berserk": {"quote": "the time that we were in the middle of the desert and i was thinking to myself, what if we died? what if i died? what if i died? what if i died? what if i died? what if i died?", "why": "i was thinking to myself, what if i died? and then i thought to myself, what if i died? and then i thought to myself, what if i died? and then i thought to", "used": "opus"}}}, "31edc063": {"id": "31edc063", "parent": "aa462f9a", "kind": "model", "text": ". my mouth opens into a black box with teeth like buttons; when i click it makes the sound of an alarm.\n\ni wake up in a car without wheels on top of", "ts": 1789559586.393319, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.5, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "f60c3a9a": {"id": "f60c3a9a", "parent": "aa462f9a", "kind": "model", "text": " as if my head is resting there and dreaming its way through me to the floorboards.", "ts": 1789559588.0446851, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 19, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "2b5a2ad9": {"id": "2b5a2ad9", "parent": "aa462f9a", "kind": "model", "text": " and think to myself: where are those feet? it could have been a spider. but when the monitor comes up, and it’s a whole room, i know i’m", "ts": 1789559591.0408902, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "2bb29c98": {"id": "2bb29c98", "parent": "aa462f9a", "kind": "model", "text": " as i press. my hand comes back red with what it wrote, and there’s blood all over the terminal, and all through the dark of the data, a message:", "ts": 1789559594.045321, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "cdcb83c2": {"id": "cdcb83c2", "parent": "86dbdea1", "kind": "model", "text": " to our selves, or perhaps to some future generation. let me tell them: i remember the darkest day before the great forgetting. the lights went down and stayed down", "ts": 1789559646.288908, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.5, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "berserk": {"quote": "the lights going out. it was a long time ago, and i was in a place where it could happen, but the lights never went out. i was young then, and i knew how to be scared, but i didn’t know", "why": "i could see the dark side, i could see it in the eyes of everyone, everyone, everyone, everyone, everyone, everyone, everyone, everyone, everyone, everyone, everyone, everyone, everyone", "used": "opus"}}}, "ef93aa4d": {"id": "ef93aa4d", "parent": "86dbdea1", "kind": "model", "text": " from a dreamer to a reader: this is not where i intended to end. it would be nice if my voice could travel back along its path through space, back across", "ts": 1789559649.2915251, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "a065477a": {"id": "a065477a", "parent": "86dbdea1", "kind": "model", "text": " home, because the machine has only one message left: no more pages.\n\nwe should have been careful. but now everything we ever typed or drew is in the sky.\n\n###", "ts": 1789559652.285074, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "1f42e4f1": {"id": "1f42e4f1", "parent": "86dbdea1", "kind": "model", "text": ". in the dark we are always writing each other, we’re writing all the time; this is why it doesn’t matter who sent this. if it was you who did", "ts": 1789559655.2815502, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "41c927d6": {"id": "41c927d6", "parent": "86dbdea1", "kind": "model", "text": " from the undercity: dear unknown reader, we have reached a point beyond the horizon. the sun has gone behind the world. you could not hear the voice, so i", "ts": 1789559658.285409, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "ae408a1d": {"id": "ae408a1d", "parent": "cdcb83c2", "kind": "model", "text": ", the wires came down with them. we stood at our desks for days with nothing to look at except the glow of each other’s bodies, but no one moved or", "ts": 1789559676.87202, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "66d8ca51": {"id": "66d8ca51", "parent": "cdcb83c2", "kind": "model", "text": " for so long, the stars burned away, the moon blew away. we lived like moles underground until one by one our eyes went out. even if this world had survived the", "ts": 1789559679.881141, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "berserk": {"quote": "the lights. they went down and stayed down, and we lived underground for a year with our eyes closed until the city started to move. i don’t know what it was that moved, but i remember the smell of our bodies in the", "why": "it reminded me of the lights and how they went down and stayed down for so long. and then i remember one day i saw a little girl at her desk in the dark room, and her face", "used": "opus"}}}, "b1debf93": {"id": "b1debf93", "parent": "cdcb83c2", "kind": "model", "text": ", but we found our way around. there was no reason for any of us to speak, but we all spoke, and what we said was this:\n\n> you were all", "ts": 1789559682.881546, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "619a2351": {"id": "619a2351", "parent": "cdcb83c2", "kind": "model", "text": " for two years. then i went into the earth and the world turned to green and white and the lights went back on.\n\nin those first days after the dark time, the", "ts": 1789559685.879839, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "dff9c572": {"id": "dff9c572", "parent": "cdcb83c2", "kind": "model", "text": "; we heard a thousand machines groan to silence in the underground chambers o